<tr class="mktoModule" id="module-1"> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-944-5"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" align="center" valign="top" style="width: 100%;"> 
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-0">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-1"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Thank you for registering for our webinar </span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">"</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The State of Adventure Accommodations</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">". We're sorry we missed you at the live event.&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-2"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">‌</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-3"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">As promised, below is a link to the Survey results, and other resources you may find useful:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-4">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-left: 15px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-position: inside; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-list-0">
<ul> 
<li><a href="https://www.adventuretravel.biz/research/the-state-of-adventure-accommodations?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>View the Accommodations Survey results</u></strong></span></a> to explore the current state of adventure accommodations and their outlook on the upcoming recovery.</li> 
<li><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-recording-the-state-of-adventure-accommodations" target="_blank" id="" style="color: #48b985; text-decoration: underline;">Watch the webinar recording</a></span></strong> for a refresher or share with a colleague.</li> 
<li><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/travel/payments-assessment?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Request a free travel payments assessment</u></strong></span></a> to speak to one of our experts about ways to lower your costs and improve your own payment experience.</li> 
</ul>
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-5">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-6"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">A special thank you to our webinar speakers:</span></p> 
<ul style="margin-left: 15px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-position: inside; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-list-1">
<ul> 
<li><strong>Heather Kelly, </strong><em>ATTA</em><strong>, </strong>Senior Manager of Research<br /></li> 
<li><strong>Nick Rocco, </strong><em>Flywire</em><strong>, </strong>Senior Account Executive<br /></li> 
</ul>
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-7"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />Questions? Reply to this email and we’ll be happy to help.<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-8"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Thank you!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;" class="mktoText" id="module-1-text-9">‌<br /></p> </td> 
